---
// src/components/blog/Comments.astro
---

<section class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-slate-200" aria-label="댓글 영역">
  <div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-between">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
      <span>💬</span>
      <span>댓글</span>
    </h2>
    <span class="text-xs text-slate-500">
      GitHub 계정으로 로그인하여 댓글을 남길 수 있습니다.
    </span>
  </div>

  <div class="giscus-container">
    <script
      src="https://giscus.app/client.js"
      data-repo="studylida/studylida.github.io"
      data-repo-id="R_kgDOUr0nCQ"
      data-category="General"
      data-category-id="DIC_kwDOUr0nCc4DKQgx"
      data-mapping="pathname"
      data-strict="0"
      data-reactions-enabled="1"
      data-emit-metadata="0"
      data-input-position="bottom"
      data-theme="light"
      data-lang="ko"
      data-loading="lazy"
      crossorigin="anonymous"
      async
    ></script>
  </div>
</section>
